      "value": "You can verify this by downloading Build `1902`, launching and testing it:\n\n1. Navigate to `steam://nav/console`.\n\n2. Download manifest 2437873671786200032 with `download_depot 438100 438101 2437873671786200032`.\n\n3. Launch VRChat from `launch.exe` from the depot download directory (`\\Steam\\steamapps\\content\\app_438100\\depot_438101\\launch.exe`).\n\n4. Print something and hold the Tab key to see it's working the way you want it to be, in Build `1902`.",
