      "value": "[VRChat 2026.3.3 (OPEN BETA)](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202633-open-beta) - September 9 - Build 1912:\n\n> Holding TAB while in first person mode will release your mouse cursor and allow you to interact with the HUD. You can also hold TAB to select players, portals, props and prints.\n\nSo it was intended. Thanks, I hate it.",
